### Run test 1
POST http://localhost:1234/test/run
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "serviceName": "{{serviceName}}",
  "token": "{{token}}",
  "ratePerSecond": 5,
  "testCount": 1000,
  "processingTimeMillis": 6000
}

### Stop running test to save time and resources
# @timeout 120
POST http://localhost:1234/test/stop/{{serviceName}}

accountName=acc-7, parallelRequests=50, rateLimitPerSec=8, price=30, averageProcessingTime=PT1.2S